2. Data We Collect

Data collected by us
We do not collect, store, or transmit any personal data.

The app saves the following data locally on your device only:
• Fill count (to track flavor unlocks)

This data never leaves your device and is not accessible to us.

Data collected by third parties

This app uses Google AdMob to display advertisements. AdMob may collect and use data including:
• Advertising identifier (IDFA/GAID)
• Device information (model, OS version)
• IP address (approximate location)
• Ad interaction data

Google's data collection is governed by Google's Privacy Policy:
https://policies.google.com/privacy

You can opt out of personalized ads at any time via:
• iOS: Settings → Privacy & Security → Apple Advertising → turn off "Personalized Ads"

⸻

